{"id":"626398","name":"豆渣馒头","author":"在水一方爱美食","authorId":"5814785","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/626398/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"3碗"},{"name":"豆渣","amount":"1碗"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆渣一碗。","img":"images/626398/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆渣加入面粉中。","img":"images/626398/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"酵母加水融化。","img":"images/626398/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"酵母水加入面粉中，搅拌后揉成面团。","img":"images/626398/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"发酵至两倍大，里面都是蜂窝状。","img":"images/626398/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"排气后揉光滑。","img":"images/626398/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉成长条。","img":"images/626398/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切成剂子。","img":"images/626398/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉成馒头，码在蒸锅中。凉水大火蒸18分钟。","img":"images/626398/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"关火后焖三到五分钟，打开锅盖。","img":"images/626398/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图来一张。","img":"images/626398/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"营养翻倍。","img":"images/626398/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}